      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi,\n\nI merged this change into the other cl aosp/2770558 that uses the KEK generated here, which should facilitate the understanding of the code for someone outside the team. Could you take a look at that cl? Thanks!",
      "revId": "29d2f776b0903239843b6a196c5ad5341383bd6c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c2bc08fb_cac483c7",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/keyblob.rs",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1836235
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-02T18:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wondered whether there\u0027s any additional metadata that could or should be bound into the KEK derivation, but I *think* this is OK for the limited context here.  Worth checking with a cryptographer though?\n\nAlso, have we considered using COSE types for this?  (We invented our own format rather than using `COSE_Encrypt0` and `COSE_Key` for KeyMint, but there was a lot more historical metadata needed there.)",
      "revId": "29d2f776b0903239843b6a196c5ad5341383bd6c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1d35f9df_baca7f05",
        "filename": "rialto/src/requests/keyblob.rs",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 53,
      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-03T08:08:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Worth checking with a cryptographer though?\n\nadded Pete.\n\n\u003e have we considered using COSE types for this?\n\nI think we can just put the raw AEAD output (ciphertext + tag) here. Currently both Microdroid and pvmfw save the AEAD-encrypted data in this way.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/instance.rs;l\u003d160;drc\u003d947f3f7ef2a444bd2df37009b714510f2f900fc9\n[2] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/microdroid_manager/src/instance.rs;l\u003d194;drc\u003d061478bca140291c354e8cf0d9d8aa9f47be8396",
      "parentUuid": "c2bc08fb_cac483c7",
      "revId": "29d2f776b0903239843b6a196c5ad5341383bd6c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
